{"reviewId": "426066534_89EitNhkJ", "review": {"abstract": "在大宗商品产能周期的10年上行期中，实际金价步入上升通道，而在产能周期的20年下行期，实际金价趋于震荡走低。尤其是在长波复苏和繁荣期，黄金-金属、黄金-农产品相对价格基本围绕一个固定中枢平稳运行。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "chapterUid": 18, "content": "这里为什么不放图了？\n从1980年到2000年，整个黄金走势都是下行的，那么这个阶段属于什么期呢？\n\n答：属于康波复苏和繁荣期，属于产能下降期，黄金/大宗商品比值趋于稳定，也就是同升同降\n\n/回头还需要再看一遍，系统梳理一下康波和几个周期之间对照", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "author": {"userVid": 426066534, "name": "阳.", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0001-o8W1y4kRnfhpyNG0a2oPXe1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "纯与真，丙丁炼庚金", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "愿祖国繁荣昌盛，国泰民安。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}, "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "6474-6572", "createTime": 1780704316, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 18, "reviewId": "426066534_89EitNhkJ", "userVid": 426066534, "topics": [], "userEditTime": 1780705706, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 0, "likes": [], "commentsCount": 2, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "而为什么复苏期和繁荣期反而产能是下降的，产能的下降主要旧产能的淘汰和新产能量少，繁荣期则因为新技术的扩散，全要素生产效率提升，旧产能彻底噶了", "reviewId": "426066534_89EitNhkJ", "commentId": "426066534_89EitNhkJ_c426066534_8bm0oyoqb", "userVid": 426066534, "createTime": 1786708573, "author": {"userVid": 426066534, "name": "阳.", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0001-o8W1y4kRnfhpyNG0a2oPXe1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, 